ean.Order.meet\">Lean.Order.meet</a> <span class=\"fn\">pre₁</span> <span class=\"fn\">pre₂</span></span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦄</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦃</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.meet\">Lean.Order.meet</a> <span class=\"fn\">post₁</span> <span class=\"fn\">post₂</span></span><a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.meet\">Lean.Order.meet</a> <span class=\"fn\">epost₁</span> <span class=\"fn\">epost₂</span></span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦄</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Conjunction of two Hoare triple specifications for a program `x`. This theorem decomposes proofs:\nprove unrelated facts about `x` separately, then combine them here.\n","docLink":"./Std/WP/Triple/Conjunctive.html#Std.WP.Triple.and","kind":"theorem","line":35,"name":"Std.WP.Triple.and","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Std/WP/Triple/Conjunctive.lean#L35-L44"}}],"imports":["Std.WP.Conjunctive","Std.WP.Triple.Basic"],"instances":[],"name":"Std.WP.Triple.Conjunctive"}